.venv
# A pattern without a slash matches at the context root ONLY, so the bare
# `__pycache__` below never matched calculations/, routers/ or util/ — their
# host-built bytecode was being COPYed into the image. The `**/` forms fix that.
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
**/*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
dist
build
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
README.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude
